{
  "title": "Cohort A - copy number and structural variant report",
  "title_zh": "队列 A 拷贝数与结构变异报告",
  "subtitle": "Simulated data · 40 patients · ASCAT copy number + Delly structural variants",
  "subtitle_zh": "模拟数据 · 40 例患者 · ASCAT 拷贝数 + Delly 结构变异",
  "language": "en",
  "genome": "hg38",
  "group_by": "Cancer type",
  "insights": [
    "Whole-genome doubling in 22 of 40 patients (55%); median ploidy 3.85, median purity 64%.",
    "Most frequent chromosome-level gains (more than half of the chromosome above round(ploidy)): chr8 and chr20 (43% of patients each), then chr1 (28%).",
    "Most frequent chromosome-level losses: chr18 (20%) and chr13 (18%).",
    "5,664 SV calls, 98% PASS; deletions (44%) and duplications (36%) dominate, followed by inversions (9%).",
    "All data in this example are simulated."
  ],
  "insights_zh": [
    "40 例中 22 例（55%）发生全基因组加倍；中位倍性 3.85，中位纯度 64%。",
    "最常见的染色体水平扩增（超过半条染色体高于 round(倍性)）：chr8 与 chr20（各 43% 的患者），其次 chr1（28%）。",
    "最常见的染色体水平缺失：chr18（20%）与 chr13（18%）。",
    "共 5,664 个结构变异，98% 为 PASS；以缺失（44%）和重复（36%）为主，其次是倒位（9%）。",
    "本示例全部为模拟数据。"
  ],
